  intro i hi hc
  rcases (show i < 7 ∨ (7 ≤ i ∧ i < 14) ∨ (14 ≤ i ∧ i < 21) ∨ (21 ≤ i ∧ i < 28) ∨ (28 ≤ i ∧ i < 35) ∨ (35 ≤ i ∧ i < 42) ∨ (42 ≤ i ∧ i < 91) ∨ (91 ≤ i ∧ i < 102) ∨ (102 ≤ i ∧ i < 117) ∨ (117 ≤ i ∧ i < 124) ∨ (124 ≤ i ∧ i < 131) ∨ (131 ≤ i ∧ i < 138) ∨ (138 ≤ i ∧ i < 145) ∨ (145 ≤ i ∧ i < 152) ∨ (152 ≤ i ∧ i < 159) ∨ (159 ≤ i ∧ i < 166) ∨ 166 ≤ i by omega) with h | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | ⟨h1, h2⟩ | h1
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor10_00
      (tailExclCaps10 heps) (Nat.zero_le _) h hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor10_01
      (tailExclCaps10 heps) h1 h2 hi hc
  · exact nodeCapNu_of_rangeOK heps tailNu_nonneg tailNu_lt_one tailAnchor10_02
